<title>LATVIA: TRASTA KOMERCBANKA 6-MO PROFIT 725,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>TRASTA KOMERCBANKA 6-MO PROFIT 725,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trasta komercbanka said on Thursday that its profit for the first six months of the year was 725,000 lats.</p>
<p>The bank also said in a statement that its assets by the end of the first half of the year were 30 million lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
